---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; import {SITE} from '../lib/config';
---
<SiteLayout title="Contact the OGCTV newsroom" description="Send a news tip, correction or community story to OGCTV on WhatsApp."><header class="page-head"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Newsroom</div><h1>Contact OGCTV</h1><p>Have a tip, document, correction or community story? The verified contact for this launch is WhatsApp.</p></div></header><div class="container static-copy contact-grid"><section class="contact-card"><h2 class="serif">Newsroom WhatsApp</h2><p class="serif" style="font-size:1.35rem">Message <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsappIntl}`}><strong>{SITE.whatsapp}</strong></a></p><p>Send the essential details: what happened, where, when, how you know, and a reliable way for a reporter to follow up. Photos or documents should include their source and date.</p><p><a class="button" href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsappIntl}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hello OGCTV newsroom, I would like to contact you about: ')}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open WhatsApp</a></p><h2 class="serif">Before you send</h2><ul><li>Do not put yourself in danger to collect evidence.</li><li>Do not send private records you are not authorised to share.</li><li>Tell us if your identity needs special protection; confidentiality must be agreed with a reporter.</li><li>Submission does not guarantee publication.</li></ul><p class="form-note">OGCTV does not publish an unverified email address, physical address or social-media account.</p></section><section class="contact-card" id="tip"><h2 class="serif">Prepare a news tip</h2><p>This helper composes a WhatsApp message in your browser. It does not upload or store your answers on this website.</p><form id="tip-form"><div class="field"><label for="topic">What is this about?</label><input id="topic" required maxlength="120" placeholder="A short headline"/></div><div class="field"><label for="place">Where did it happen?</label><input id="place" maxlength="120" placeholder="Town, community or landmark"/></div><div class="field"><label for="when">When?</label><input id="when" maxlength="100" placeholder="Date and approximate time"/></div><div class="field"><label for="details">What should the newsroom know?</label><textarea id="details" required maxlength="1500" placeholder="Describe what you saw or the information you can support."></textarea></div><button class="button">Continue in WhatsApp</button></form></section></div><script define:vars={{number:SITE.whatsappIntl}}>document.getElementById('tip-form')?.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const v=id=>document.getElementById(id).value.trim();const msg=`Hello OGCTV newsroom, I have a news tip.\n\nTOPIC: ${v('topic')}\nPLACE: ${v('place')||'Not provided'}\nWHEN: ${v('when')||'Not provided'}\nDETAILS: ${v('details')}`;window.open(`https://wa.me/${number}?text=${encodeURIComponent(msg)}`,'_blank','noopener')})</script></SiteLayout>
